      "cooked": "<p>It’s Spelf time</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-320-writers-room-cosmic-tales-vol-2-244\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-320-writers-room-cosmic-tales-vol-2-244\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img width=\"250\" height=\"250\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/a/a207b25d5dc8a6620aab8ce801ba438ae9da3f25.png\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" data-dominant-color=\"837B72\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-320-writers-room-cosmic-tales-vol-2-244\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">The Letters Page: Episode #320 - Writer's Room: Cosmic Tales Vol. 2 #244</a></h3>\n\n  <p>Who is going to space?!  Run Time: 2:18:24 We crafted twice, told once for this one! We planned out the majority of this story before recording... and yet, we still crafted quite a bit of lore on the air, in a variety of ways that surprised even us!...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/8/83708a57b355f5a6ec33892c3fe5abde7adedaab.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/83708a57b355f5a6ec33892c3fe5abde7adedaab\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/8/83708a57b355f5a6ec33892c3fe5abde7adedaab_2_322x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"iKLFfvEpIqE7AG1QIAArX6HCPR9\" width=\"322\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/8/83708a57b355f5a6ec33892c3fe5abde7adedaab_2_322x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com