    {
      "id": 265633,
      "name": "KateWalker",
      "username": "TakeWalker",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2026-06-10T02:34:47.428Z",
      "cooked": "<p><s>320 blaze it!</s></p>\n<p>Oh my god, this cover is fantastic. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Instant fave. Cannot wait to find out what the hell is going on!</p>\n<p>Also, new website design! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/open_mouth.png?v=12\" title=\":open_mouth:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":open_mouth:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>Transluceaneum is actually pretty good imo</p>\n<p>Man, chat last night was just talking about how we’ve only seen Greazer in more heroic roles on the podcast so far. This is so well timed!</p>\n<p>I love Sky-Scraper’s confidence that all spaceships drive basically the same.</p>\n<p>“Do you wanna make out about it?” I like this guy.</p>\n<p>Space elves is definitely something Sentinel Comics needed. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> I could feel the hole in canon being filled.</p>\n<p>…Okay, I guess Greazer isn’t going to be much of a villain in this one, either. XD Someone suggest a topic!</p>\n<p>So, Kollapse is definitely a villain they’ve mentioned before and I just forgot about, riiiiight??</p>\n<p>The story of this goofy space elf planet is coming together so well, this is just fantastic. XD “That wouldn’t happen.” Incredible.</p>\n<p>The ships are in fact the only thing you can hear in space. XD</p>\n<p>Ope, Greazer’s a villain again! Huzzah!</p>\n<p>Ahh, so this is how they avoid implementing the multiple character cards in DE. :V</p>\n<p>Kollapse with a K, and the K is for kick-flip.</p>\n<p>Hell yes, Sky-Sky gets smoochies. Great story!</p>\n<p>Yay for bleak romance prospects! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> I would read the hell out of Star Crossers, no lie.</p>\n<p>Man, I need an issue about someone robbing a space bank.</p>\n<p>“Somehow, the Cult of Gloom has returned.” I love this bit so much. XD</p>\n<p>We definitely need Guise in space, too.</p>\n<p>A Sentinel Comics opera, about how criminals are a cowardly lot.</p>\n<p>…Okay, that happened.</p>\n<p>It’s very cool that people have found the podcast without knowing about the game. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Like, that makes me feel really good.</p>",
